  triage:closureNote "Fixed on fix/admission-writer-batching-regression commit f3e39913b (test(storage): cover batch wait disconnect): added batch_collection_marks_shutdown_when_sender_disconnects_while_waiting, a paused-clock test that drops the sender only after collect_batch parks in timeout_at, exercising the previously-untested Ok(None) mid-wait disconnect branch. PR #982 merged to integrate/phase-ao2 at b7054fb95 (2026-08-22T06:15:51Z). quality-mgr independently re-verified via fresh worktree + real cargo test run; PR #982 CI fully green (19/19 checks) confirmed via gh CLI." ;
